{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260s5mzOGy3t1792737112.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產荃灣西站第二分行B組高級分區營業經理林恩信表示，荃灣西一帶年輕屋苑租盤需求持續殷切，當中海景三房更一直是搶手貨。<br/>林恩信表示，分行最新促成環宇海灣3座極高層F室租賃成交，實用面積713平方呎，屬優質3房戶，三房套房間隔。單位位處極高層，坐擁開揚優美海景，並且附帶企理裝修，放盤僅1日，即獲家庭客以月租3.1萬元承租，實用呎租43.5元。<br/>據悉，業主於2014年以約785萬元購入單位，最新租金回報高達約4.7厘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:43:58.898250+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T05:58:10.696784+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:38:14.889669+00:00","content_hash":"f7bcc4b61fefd772e09771015490f0ee6ba9f88ff19f4ed173480ec07944f855","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:43:58.898250+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}